        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "A repeating pattern in blue incorporating two birds is on a gold ground."@en , "double cloth, 1580-1630, Italian ?; Birds on floral lattice, blue cotton yellow silk"@en , "This woven furnishing fabric has a yellow silk ground, its design of birds and flowers made with patterning wefts of blue cotton. Traces of silk fringe suggest that it may have been used as a wall-hanging or canopy."@en ;
